---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">IOT SPECIALIST • EDGE • CLOUD • DIGITAL SYSTEMS</div>
          <h1>We connect everything here<br />for making better decisions</h1>
          <p>
            I design industrial telemetry systems that connect sensors, edge devices,
            cloud platforms, and operational insight into a single decision-ready view.
          </p>
          <div class="buttons">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#projects">Explore projects</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/Venkatesh-Bokka-Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Download resume</a>
            <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
            <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/venkatesh-bokka-983b99126/" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><strong>8+</strong><span>Years engineering</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>AWS</strong><span>Cloud & IoT</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>Edge</strong><span>Embedded systems</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>Ops</strong><span>System insight</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Industrial plant overview">
           <div class="panel panel-main" aria-label="Industrial plant overview">
            <div class="signal signal-live"></div>
            <div class="scene-title">Plant Overview</div>
            <div class="scene">
              <div class="tank tank-a"></div>
              <div class="tank tank-b"></div>
              <div class="pipe pipe-1"></div>
              <div class="pipe pipe-2"></div>
              <div class="pump"></div>
              <div class="valve"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="readout-row">
              <span>Tank 01</span>
              <strong>72%</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="readout-row muted">
              <span>Pump 01</span>
              <strong>Running</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mockup-section">
      <div class="container mockup-wrap">
        <div class="mockup-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">Live plant view</div>
          <h2>Operational context, not just telemetry.</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Each asset is mapped to a live process state so the operator can understand
            equipment condition, level, flow, and service health in a single visual frame.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mockup-panel">
          <div class="mockup-header">
            <span>Plant / Operations</span>
            <span class="status-pill">LIVE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-scene">
            <div class="mini-tank"></div>
            <div class="mini-pipe"></div>
            <div class="mini-pump"></div>
            <div class="mini-valve"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-stats">
            <div><label>Tank 01</label><strong>72%</strong></div>
            <div><label>Pump 01</label><strong>Running</strong></div>
            <div><label>Last sync</label><strong>12s ago</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">01 / About</div>
        <h2>Engineering systems that connect the field to the model.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          I work across the full IoT stack: device telemetry, edge data acquisition,
          MQTT and cloud transport, asset monitoring, and live operational visualization.
          The goal is to turn process data into a clear, operational view of the plant.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">02 / Technical focus</div>
        <h2>From raw signal to visual insight.</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Cloud & IoT</h3>
            <p>AWS IoT Core, Azure IoT Hub, device identity, telemetry routing and cloud APIs.</p>
            <span class="tag">AWS</span><span class="tag">Azure</span><span class="tag">IoT</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Industrial Connectivity</h3>
            <p>Modbus, OPC UA, LoRaWAN, MQTT, field gateways, and edge processing for industrial systems.</p>
            <span class="tag">OPC UA</span><span class="tag">MQTT</span><span class="tag">LoRaWAN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Edge & Embedded</h3>
            <p>ESP32, Raspberry Pi, Linux-based systems, data acquisition, and platform integration at the edge.</p>
            <span class="tag">ESP32</span><span class="tag">Linux</span><span class="tag">Edge</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Data & Analytics</h3>
            <p>Telemetry validation, trend analysis, time-series data, and operational monitoring for plant systems.</p>
            <span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Analytics</span><span class="tag">ML</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>System Design</h3>
            <p>End-to-end architecture from sensor acquisition to cloud services and user-facing operational views.</p>
            <span class="tag">Architecture</span><span class="tag">Design</span><span class="tag">Ops</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">03 / Project focus</div>
        <h2>Industrial IoT workflows and connected systems.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Selected project themes that connect process instrumentation, remote monitoring,
          and operational visualization into a usable engineering story.
        </p>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card project-card">
            <h3>Sensor to Blender</h3>
            <p>Model a plant with live tank, pump, and valve states visualized from telemetry data.</p>
            <span class="tag">Blender</span><span class="tag">Digital twin</span>
              <span class="tag">Sensor</span><span class="tag">Visualization</span>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">View project ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card project-card">
            <h3>Plant Telemetry</h3>
            <p>Collect industrial readings from field devices and route them into a validated data pipeline.</p>
            <span class="tag">MQTT</span><span class="tag">Telemetry</span>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">View project ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card project-card">
            <h3>Edge Gateway</h3>
            <p>Connect sensor protocols, normalize device data, and package it for cloud or local visualization.</p>
            <span class="tag">Edge</span><span class="tag">Gateway</span>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">View project ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card project-card">
            <h3>Ops Dashboard</h3>
            <p>Surface live machine state, last-update timestamps, alarms, and quality indicators for operators.</p>
            <span class="tag">Dashboards</span><span class="tag">Monitoring</span>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">View project ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card project-card">
            <h3>Azure & AWS Integration</h3>
            <p>Design secure, scalable IoT integrations across cloud-native device provisioning and data services.</p>
            <span class="tag">AWS</span><span class="tag">Azure</span>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">View project ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card project-card">
            <h3>Industrial Automation</h3>
            <p>Combine PLC, OPC UA, MQTT, and asset health signals into a model that operators can understand.</p>
            <span class="tag">Industrial</span><span class="tag">Automation</span>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">View project ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="architecture">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">04 / Architecture</div>
        <h2>Built in layers, from field data to 3D awareness.</h2>
        <div class="arch-blocks">
          <div class="arch-step"><span>01</span><h3>Measure</h3><p>Sensor, PLC, simulator, or edge device generates real-world values.</p></div>
          <div class="arch-step"><span>02</span><h3>Acquire</h3><p>MQTT, Modbus, OPC UA, and edge processing normalize the signal.</p></div>
          <div class="arch-step"><span>03</span><h3>Model</h3><p>Backend validates telemetry and binds values to named asset objects.</p></div>
          <div class="arch-step"><span>04</span><h3>Visualize</h3><p>Web tooling converts asset state into a clear operational view.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-band">
      <div class="container feature-strip">
        <div class="feature-item"><strong>MQTT</strong><span>Data routing</span></div>
        <div class="feature-item"><strong>OPC UA</strong><span>Industrial interfaces</span></div>
        <div class="feature-item"><strong>AWS / Azure</strong><span>Cloud integration</span></div>
        <div class="feature-item"><strong>Python</strong><span>Data and automation</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container contact-box">
        <div class="eyebrow">05 / Contact</div>
        <h2>Let’s build connected systems worth seeing.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          I’m open to project discussions around industrial IoT, smart monitoring,
          cloud connectivity, edge systems, and operational visualization.
        </p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:venkateshbokka232@gmail.com">Email me</a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/venkatesh-bokka-983b99126/" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Venkatesh Bokka</span>
      <span>Built for connected systems.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
